 "_source": "Knightbook 'A Knight's Tale: Paracelsa' (p.3–4 rules & Knight Setup) + Portrait / Talent / Heroic Arc / Technique sprite sheets (owner-supplied 2026-11-16).",
 "specialRules": {
  "zeal": "Paracelsa uses special Zeal tokens as a resource. When an effect instructs you to spend a Zeal token, move 1 Zeal token from your Knight Board into the Knight Pool or discard 1 Zeal token from the Knight Pool. Zeal X: During the second ability window, place X Zeal tokens on your Knight Board. Zeal Threshold X: If gaining Zeal tokens would cause you to exceed your Zeal Threshold, gain Zeal tokens up to your Zeal Threshold and place the rest of the tokens in the Knight Pool. Falsity: During the Attack Roll step, you may re-roll your Crit die without gaining [Heat]. If you re-roll a Crit die that's already a hit, immediately gain 1 Zeal token."
 },
